1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,797
I can't even find small jobs. Just my luck!

2
00:00:03,097 --> 00:00:07,773
Munna, every home needs clothes ironed, every day! Open an ironing stall!

3
00:00:08,073 --> 00:00:10,316
An ironing stall? How much can that earn, Chacha?

4
00:00:10,616 --> 00:00:16,997
A heavy iron, a table and a corner outside a housing society. Just ₹10,000.

5
00:00:17,297 --> 00:00:22,082
Take orders on WhatsApp, pick up from homes, deliver back. That's your service.

6
00:00:22,632 --> 00:00:26,705
Munna, I need these twenty clothes by evening. My husband has a meeting!

7
00:00:27,005 --> 00:00:29,969
Done by evening, aunty ji. ₹15 a piece.

8
00:00:30,269 --> 00:00:37,311
One hundred fifty to two hundred pieces a day means ₹2,000 to ₹3,000 a day.

9
00:00:37,611 --> 00:00:42,722
Get a steam iron and tie up with a dry cleaner. You earn commission on every piece.

10
00:00:43,022 --> 00:00:45,986
Munna Press Wala, the whole society's favourite! Life set!
